  "description": "LIGHTWEIGHT AGILITY, E-POWER ON DEMAND The KTM Carbon e-road bike MACINA REVELATOR SX Prime offers an even more intense road experience for a wide range of cyclists. The Bosch Performance Line SX motor provides smooth and natural assistance exactly when it’s needed. Tired legs are now a thing of the past. The frame is defined by its aerodynamic qualities, while the Classified hub provides a wide gear range. This concept keeps the e-road bike both technically and visually cutting-edge, serving as a testimonial for the ease of cycling. These models also feature KTM’s own POWER TUBE TOP LOADER (PTTL) innovation, which provides user-friendly battery handling. The CompactTube 400Wh battery can be easily removed from the top of the frametube, simplifying the process of removal and reinsertion, making it easy to bring a spare battery for longer tours. KTM also offers clever solutions from their accessories range for this purpose: the Sport Trunk Bag saddlebag and the Battery Board backpack insert are specifically designed to carry a spare battery. Another way to extend the range is th e BOSCH PowerMore Range Extender with 250Wh, which can be mounted directly on the battery cover. The charging port has been adapted to support this feature.",
